{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52545","headline":"至人行 · 陈元光","name":"至人行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至人平念虑，好恶归其衷。\n试剑三苗罪，同车盖世雄。\n断蛟驱猛虎，附凤翊飞龙。\n际会风云上，清平岭海中。\n穷民加保惠，勳士禄功庸。\n姝子干旌纰，妖淫桎[梏]（桔）凶。\n热筹消{氵灾}气，精盖啓宸聪。\n卓尔三才立，岿哉一道同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}